{
 "slug": "2026-11-03-late-bloom-automation",
 "scenes": [
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "say": "For thirty years, David was the guy who fixed things when they broke. A senior maintenance tech in Georgia, he knew every relay, valve, and air line in the plant.",
   "html": "<div class=\"kick\">The Late-Bloom Automation Architect</div><svg width=\"900\" height=\"760\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 760\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"display:block;margin:10px auto 0\">\n<rect x=\"150\" y=\"40\" width=\"600\" height=\"660\" rx=\"22\" stroke=\"#8f9aa6\" stroke-width=\"6\"/>\n<line x1=\"190\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#3a4654\" stroke-width=\"10\"/>\n<line x1=\"190\" y1=\"390\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"390\" stroke=\"#3a4654\" stroke-width=\"10\"/>\n<rect x=\"200\" y=\"170\" width=\"70\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"235\" cy=\"205\" r=\"12\" stroke=\"#36cfc9\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"215\" y1=\"290\" x2=\"255\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><rect x=\"300\" y=\"170\" width=\"70\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"335\" cy=\"205\" r=\"12\" stroke=\"#36cfc9\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"315\" y1=\"290\" x2=\"355\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><rect x=\"400\" y=\"170\" width=\"70\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"435\" cy=\"205\" r=\"12\" stroke=\"#36cfc9\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"415\" y1=\"290\" x2=\"455\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><rect x=\"500\" y=\"170\" width=\"70\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"535\" cy=\"205\" r=\"12\" stroke=\"#36cfc9\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"515\" y1=\"290\" x2=\"555\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><rect x=\"600\" y=\"170\" width=\"70\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"635\" cy=\"205\" r=\"12\" stroke=\"#36cfc9\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"615\" y1=\"290\" x2=\"655\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"420\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" rx=\"14\" stroke=\"#ffc53d\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"480\" r=\"30\" stroke=\"#ffc53d\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><rect x=\"370\" y=\"420\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" rx=\"14\" stroke=\"#ffc53d\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"430\" cy=\"480\" r=\"30\" stroke=\"#ffc53d\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><rect x=\"540\" y=\"420\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" rx=\"14\" stroke=\"#ffc53d\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"600\" cy=\"480\" r=\"30\" stroke=\"#ffc53d\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><path d=\"M200 600 C 300 640, 400 560, 500 620 S 650 600, 700 640\" stroke=\"#36cfc9\" stroke-width=\"5\"/>\n<path d=\"M200 650 C 320 690, 420 610, 520 670 S 650 650, 700 690\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"5\"/></svg><div class=\"lbl\" style=\"font-size:58px;color:#f5f7fa\">30 years of relays, valves and air lines</div><div class=\"src\" style=\"bottom:240px;text-align:center\">A dramatized story. David is a fictional character.</div>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "say": "But the machines were moving behind digital walls. When a line went down on a software fault, David had to wait for an outside contractor with a laptop.",
   "html": "<div class=\"kick\">The digital wall</div><svg width=\"900\" height=\"760\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 760\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"display:block;margin:10px auto 0\">\n<rect x=\"120\" y=\"110\" width=\"660\" height=\"460\" rx=\"24\" stroke=\"#8f9aa6\" stroke-width=\"6\"/>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"150\" width=\"580\" height=\"380\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0b1520\" stroke=\"#2a3644\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n<text x=\"190\" y=\"205\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#3d5266\">XIC Line_Run   OTE Conv_M1</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"253\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#3d5266\">TON T4:0  PRE 5000  ACC 0</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"301\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#3d5266\">MOV N7:12  F8:3  SCP 0 4095</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"349\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#3d5266\">JSR Seq_Main  RES C5:1</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"397\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#3d5266\">XIO Fault_Latch  OTU Ready</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"445\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#3d5266\">EQU State 30  ONS B3:2/4</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"493\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#3d5266\">MOV 0  N7:40  CPT F8:9</text><rect x=\"330\" y=\"300\" width=\"240\" height=\"190\" rx=\"26\" fill=\"#04070b\" stroke=\"#ff6b5a\" stroke-width=\"10\"/>\n<path d=\"M380 300 V245 a70 70 0 0 1 140 0 V300\" stroke=\"#ff6b5a\" stroke-width=\"10\"/>\n<circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"385\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#ff6b5a\"/><rect x=\"442\" y=\"395\" width=\"16\" height=\"50\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ff6b5a\"/>\n<text x=\"450\" y=\"660\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"M,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"800\" font-size=\"46\" fill=\"#ff6b5a\">LINE DOWN \u00b7 SOFTWARE FAULT</text></svg><div class=\"lbl\" style=\"font-size:58px;color:#f5f7fa\">A software fault meant waiting</div><div class=\"foot\">Syon Automation LLC</div>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "say": "They'd plug in, click a few buttons, bill thousands for an hour, and leave.",
   "html": "<div class=\"kick\">Plug in. Click. Invoice.</div><svg width=\"900\" height=\"760\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 760\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"display:block;margin:10px auto 0\">\n<rect x=\"60\" y=\"250\" width=\"440\" height=\"290\" rx=\"18\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"6\"/>\n<rect x=\"90\" y=\"280\" width=\"380\" height=\"220\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0b1520\"/>\n<path d=\"M20 560 H540 L500 600 H60 Z\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"6\"/>\n<line x1=\"270\" y1=\"560\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"700\" stroke=\"#8f9aa6\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-dasharray=\"14 12\"/>\n<text x=\"280\" y=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"M,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#36cfc9\">ONLINE</text>\n<rect x=\"560\" y=\"90\" width=\"300\" height=\"420\" rx=\"14\" stroke=\"#ffc53d\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"#0d1116\"/>\n<text x=\"710\" y=\"160\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"M,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"800\" font-size=\"40\" fill=\"#ffc53d\">INVOICE</text>\n<line x1=\"600\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"820\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#8f9aa6\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n<text x=\"600\" y=\"260\" font-family=\"M,sans-serif\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#b8c2cc\">Call-out</text>\n<text x=\"600\" y=\"310\" font-family=\"M,sans-serif\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#b8c2cc\">1 hr on site</text>\n<line x1=\"600\" y1=\"360\" x2=\"820\" y2=\"360\" stroke=\"#8f9aa6\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n<text x=\"600\" y=\"440\" font-family=\"M,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"800\" font-size=\"54\" fill=\"#ffc53d\">$$$$</text></svg><div class=\"lbl\" style=\"font-size:62px;color:#ffc53d\">Thousands of dollars for an hour</div><div class=\"foot\">Syon Automation LLC</div>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "say": "Thirty years of hands-on know-how, and he still had to wait. David wanted control of his own career.",
   "html": "<div class=\"kick\">Trapped</div><svg width=\"900\" height=\"760\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 760\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"display:block;margin:10px auto 0\">\n<circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"330\" r=\"230\" stroke=\"#8f9aa6\" stroke-width=\"10\"/>\n<line x1=\"450\" y1=\"330\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#ffc53d\" stroke-width=\"14\"/>\n<line x1=\"450\" y1=\"330\" x2=\"570\" y2=\"400\" stroke=\"#ffc53d\" stroke-width=\"14\"/>\n<circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"330\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#ffc53d\"/>\n<line x1=\"650.0\" y1=\"330.0\" x2=\"672.0\" y2=\"330.0\" stroke=\"#8f9aa6\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><line x1=\"623.2\" y1=\"430.0\" x2=\"642.3\" y2=\"441.0\" stroke=\"#8f9aa6\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><line x1=\"550.0\" y1=\"503.2\" x2=\"561.0\" y2=\"522.3\" stroke=\"#8f9aa6\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><line x1=\"450.0\" y1=\"530.0\" x2=\"450.0\" y2=\"552.0\" stroke=\"#8f9aa6\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><line x1=\"350.0\" y1=\"503.2\" x2=\"339.0\" y2=\"522.3\" stroke=\"#8f9aa6\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><line x1=\"276.8\" y1=\"430.0\" x2=\"257.7\" y2=\"441.0\" stroke=\"#8f9aa6\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><line x1=\"250.0\" y1=\"330.0\" x2=\"228.0\" y2=\"330.0\" stroke=\"#8f9aa6\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><line x1=\"276.8\" y1=\"230.0\" x2=\"257.7\" y2=\"219.0\" stroke=\"#8f9aa6\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><line x1=\"350.0\" y1=\"156.8\" x2=\"339.0\" y2=\"137.7\" stroke=\"#8f9aa6\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><line x1=\"450.0\" y1=\"130.0\" x2=\"450.0\" y2=\"108.0\" stroke=\"#8f9aa6\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><line x1=\"550.0\" y1=\"156.8\" x2=\"561.0\" y2=\"137.7\" stroke=\"#8f9aa6\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><line x1=\"623.2\" y1=\"230.0\" x2=\"642.3\" y2=\"219.0\" stroke=\"#8f9aa6\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><text x=\"450\" y=\"680\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"M,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"800\" font-size=\"56\" fill=\"#ff6b5a\">Still waiting on the contractor</text></svg><div class=\"lbl\" style=\"font-size:58px;color:#f5f7fa\">He wanted control of his own career</div><div class=\"foot\">Syon Automation LLC</div>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s5",
   "say": "At fifty-nine, he decided he wasn't done growing. He found PLC training built for technicians like him.",
   "html": "<div class=\"kick\">The turning point</div><div class=\"big\" style=\"color:#36cfc9\">59</div><div class=\"lbl\" style=\"font-size:70px;color:#f5f7fa\">and not done growing</div><div class=\"sub\">PLC training built for technicians</div><div class=\"foot\">Syon Automation LLC</div>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s6",
   "say": "No computer science theory. Every rung of ladder logic was tied to a real device, so a bit in the program meant a cylinder moving on a real conveyor.",
   "html": "<div class=\"kick\">Ladder logic, tied to real devices</div><svg width=\"900\" height=\"760\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 760\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"display:block;margin:10px auto 0\">\n<line x1=\"60\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#4fd39a\" stroke-width=\"10\"/>\n<line x1=\"840\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"840\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#8f9aa6\" stroke-width=\"10\"/>\n<line x1=\"60\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#4fd39a\" stroke-width=\"8\"/>\n<line x1=\"300\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#4fd39a\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#4fd39a\" stroke-width=\"8\"/>\n<line x1=\"350\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"560\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#4fd39a\" stroke-width=\"8\"/>\n<path d=\"M590 125 Q560 180 590 235\" stroke=\"#4fd39a\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><path d=\"M650 125 Q680 180 650 235\" stroke=\"#4fd39a\" stroke-width=\"8\"/>\n<line x1=\"680\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"840\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#8f9aa6\" stroke-width=\"8\"/>\n<text x=\"325\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#e6edf3\">Part_Present</text>\n<text x=\"620\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#e6edf3\">Push_Cyl</text>\n<text x=\"325\" y=\"275\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#8f9aa6\">XIC</text>\n<text x=\"620\" y=\"275\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#8f9aa6\">OTE</text>\n<path d=\"M620 300 V390\" stroke=\"#36cfc9\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-dasharray=\"12 10\"/><path d=\"M600 372 L620 400 L640 372\" stroke=\"#36cfc9\" stroke-width=\"6\"/>\n<rect x=\"430\" y=\"420\" width=\"300\" height=\"110\" rx=\"14\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"7\"/>\n<rect x=\"455\" y=\"445\" width=\"80\" height=\"60\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#2fa4ff\"/>\n<line x1=\"535\" y1=\"475\" x2=\"840\" y2=\"475\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"14\"/>\n<rect x=\"820\" y=\"440\" width=\"30\" height=\"70\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#2fa4ff\"/>\n<rect x=\"60\" y=\"600\" width=\"780\" height=\"40\" rx=\"20\" stroke=\"#8f9aa6\" stroke-width=\"6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"620\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#8f9aa6\"/><circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"620\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#8f9aa6\"/><circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"620\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#8f9aa6\"/><circle cx=\"520\" cy=\"620\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#8f9aa6\"/><circle cx=\"660\" cy=\"620\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#8f9aa6\"/><circle cx=\"800\" cy=\"620\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#8f9aa6\"/><rect x=\"300\" y=\"540\" width=\"120\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" stroke=\"#ffc53d\" stroke-width=\"6\"/></svg><div class=\"lbl\" style=\"font-size:56px;color:#f5f7fa\">One bit. One cylinder. One conveyor.</div><div class=\"foot\">Syon Automation LLC</div>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s7",
   "say": "In the evenings he worked through it: controller organization, mapping inputs and outputs, Studio five thousand, and Siemens T I A Portal.",
   "html": "<div class=\"kick\">Evenings, one module at a time</div><img class=\"shot\" style=\"width:960px\" src=\"{IMG}/rw/sealin.webp\"><div class=\"sub\" style=\"color:#f5f7fa;font-weight:700;margin-top:44px\">Controller organization \u00b7 I/O mapping<br>Studio 5000 \u00b7 Siemens TIA Portal</div><div class=\"foot\">Syon Automation LLC</div>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s8",
   "say": "The wall of code turned into a map he could read. His thirty years of troubleshooting finally had a keyboard.",
   "html": "<div class=\"kick\">From wall of code to a map</div><img class=\"shot\" style=\"width:960px\" src=\"{IMG}/rw/pid.webp\"><div class=\"lbl\" style=\"font-size:54px;color:#f5f7fa\">30 years of troubleshooting, now with a keyboard</div><div class=\"foot\">Syon Automation LLC</div>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s9",
   "say": "Then he went out on his own, and opened his own consulting firm.",
   "html": "<div class=\"kick\">A new class of freedom</div><svg width=\"900\" height=\"760\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 760\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"display:block;margin:10px auto 0\">\n<rect x=\"90\" y=\"140\" width=\"720\" height=\"420\" rx=\"26\" fill=\"#0b1118\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"5\"/>\n<rect x=\"130\" y=\"190\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" rx=\"14\" stroke=\"#36cfc9\" stroke-width=\"6\"/>\n<path d=\"M145 225 H185 M165 205 V245\" stroke=\"#36cfc9\" stroke-width=\"6\"/>\n<text x=\"225\" y=\"245\" font-family=\"M,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"800\" font-size=\"52\" fill=\"#f5f7fa\">Nexus Applied Logic</text>\n<line x1=\"130\" y1=\"300\" x2=\"770\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#22303f\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n<text x=\"130\" y=\"370\" font-family=\"M,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" font-size=\"40\" fill=\"#f5f7fa\">David Miller</text>\n<text x=\"130\" y=\"420\" font-family=\"M,sans-serif\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#36cfc9\">PLC Programming \u00b7 Controls Consulting</text>\n<text x=\"130\" y=\"500\" font-family=\"M,sans-serif\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#8f9aa6\">Independent \u00b7 Georgia</text></svg><div class=\"lbl\" style=\"font-size:64px;color:#f5f7fa\">His own consulting firm</div><div class=\"foot\">Syon Automation LLC</div>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s10",
   "say": "Plants noticed. He could walk up to a struggling line, find the mechanical bottleneck, then go online with the PLC and tighten the cycle time and the safety logic.",
   "html": "<div class=\"kick\">Both worlds: the machine and the code</div><svg width=\"900\" height=\"760\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 760\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"display:block;margin:10px auto 0\">\n<rect x=\"40\" y=\"420\" width=\"820\" height=\"50\" rx=\"25\" stroke=\"#8f9aa6\" stroke-width=\"6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"445\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#8f9aa6\"/><circle cx=\"185\" cy=\"445\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#8f9aa6\"/><circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"445\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#8f9aa6\"/><circle cx=\"395\" cy=\"445\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#8f9aa6\"/><circle cx=\"500\" cy=\"445\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#8f9aa6\"/><circle cx=\"605\" cy=\"445\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#8f9aa6\"/><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"445\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#8f9aa6\"/><circle cx=\"815\" cy=\"445\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#8f9aa6\"/><rect x=\"120\" y=\"350\" width=\"110\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\" stroke=\"#ffc53d\" stroke-width=\"6\"/><rect x=\"350\" y=\"350\" width=\"110\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\" stroke=\"#ffc53d\" stroke-width=\"6\"/><rect x=\"580\" y=\"350\" width=\"110\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\" stroke=\"#ffc53d\" stroke-width=\"6\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"520\" width=\"200\" height=\"180\" rx=\"12\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"6\"/><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"590\" r=\"40\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"6\"/>\n<text x=\"180\" y=\"680\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#8f9aa6\">PLC</text>\n<path d=\"M280 610 H420\" stroke=\"#36cfc9\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-dasharray=\"12 10\"/>\n<rect x=\"430\" y=\"540\" width=\"300\" height=\"160\" rx=\"14\" stroke=\"#36cfc9\" stroke-width=\"6\"/>\n<text x=\"580\" y=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"M,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#36cfc9\">ONLINE EDIT</text>\n<text x=\"580\" y=\"660\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"M,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"800\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#f5f7fa\">14.2 s \u2192 11.8 s</text>\n<text x=\"450\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"M,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"800\" font-size=\"50\" fill=\"#f5f7fa\">Cycle time</text>\n<text x=\"450\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"M,sans-serif\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#8f9aa6\">example</text>\n<path d=\"M150 260 H750\" stroke=\"#22303f\" stroke-width=\"4\"/></svg><div class=\"lbl\" style=\"font-size:60px;color:#f5f7fa\">Find the bottleneck. Fix it online.</div><div class=\"foot\">Syon Automation LLC</div>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s11",
   "say": "Word of mouth did the rest: logic for high-speed packaging lines, secure remote monitoring, and plants that keep running.",
   "html": "<div class=\"kick\">Client by client</div><svg width=\"900\" height=\"760\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 760\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"display:block;margin:10px auto 0\">\n<circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"380\" r=\"70\" fill=\"#0b1118\" stroke=\"#36cfc9\" stroke-width=\"7\"/>\n<text x=\"450\" y=\"395\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"M,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"800\" font-size=\"40\" fill=\"#36cfc9\">D</text>\n<line x1=\"450\" y1=\"380\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 10\"/><rect x=\"95\" y=\"95\" width=\"110\" height=\"90\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#04070b\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><path d=\"M115 165 V130 L140 145 V130 L165 145 V115 H185 V165 Z\" stroke=\"#ffc53d\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"450\" y1=\"380\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 10\"/><rect x=\"395\" y=\"55\" width=\"110\" height=\"90\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#04070b\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><path d=\"M415 125 V90 L440 105 V90 L465 105 V75 H485 V125 Z\" stroke=\"#ffc53d\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"450\" y1=\"380\" x2=\"750\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 10\"/><rect x=\"695\" y=\"95\" width=\"110\" height=\"90\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#04070b\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><path d=\"M715 165 V130 L740 145 V130 L765 145 V115 H785 V165 Z\" stroke=\"#ffc53d\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"450\" y1=\"380\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"420\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 10\"/><rect x=\"75\" y=\"375\" width=\"110\" height=\"90\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#04070b\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><path d=\"M95 445 V410 L120 425 V410 L145 425 V395 H165 V445 Z\" stroke=\"#ffc53d\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"450\" y1=\"380\" x2=\"770\" y2=\"420\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 10\"/><rect x=\"715\" y=\"375\" width=\"110\" height=\"90\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#04070b\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><path d=\"M735 445 V410 L760 425 V410 L785 425 V395 H805 V445 Z\" stroke=\"#ffc53d\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"450\" y1=\"380\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"660\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 10\"/><rect x=\"165\" y=\"615\" width=\"110\" height=\"90\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#04070b\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><path d=\"M185 685 V650 L210 665 V650 L235 665 V635 H255 V685 Z\" stroke=\"#ffc53d\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"450\" y1=\"380\" x2=\"680\" y2=\"660\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 10\"/><rect x=\"625\" y=\"615\" width=\"110\" height=\"90\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#04070b\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><path d=\"M645 685 V650 L670 665 V650 L695 665 V635 H715 V685 Z\" stroke=\"#ffc53d\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"450\" y=\"560\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"M,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#8f9aa6\">word of mouth</text></svg><div class=\"lbl\" style=\"font-size:56px;color:#f5f7fa\">Packaging lines \u00b7 remote monitoring</div><div class=\"foot\">Syon Automation LLC</div>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s12",
   "say": "With secure remote access, his office goes where he goes. Some days it's a seat over the Pacific, reviewing a ladder routine on the way to a client in Guam.",
   "html": "<div class=\"kick\">The office, at 35,000 feet</div><svg width=\"900\" height=\"760\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 760\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"display:block;margin:10px auto 0\">\n<rect x=\"200\" y=\"30\" width=\"500\" height=\"430\" rx=\"200\" fill=\"#0a1a2c\" stroke=\"#8f9aa6\" stroke-width=\"14\"/>\n<rect x=\"232\" y=\"62\" width=\"436\" height=\"366\" rx=\"180\" fill=\"#103152\"/>\n<rect x=\"232\" y=\"300\" width=\"436\" height=\"128\" fill=\"#0b2a49\"/>\n<circle cx=\"560\" cy=\"170\" r=\"34\" fill=\"#ffc53d\" opacity=\".9\"/>\n<path d=\"M260 300 H640\" stroke=\"#3f7fb8\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n<path d=\"M300 240 q30 -18 60 0 M400 220 q30 -18 60 0\" stroke=\"#7fb3e0\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n<rect x=\"250\" y=\"520\" width=\"400\" height=\"22\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#26303b\"/>\n<rect x=\"300\" y=\"380\" width=\"300\" height=\"140\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"#0b1520\"/>\n<line x1=\"320\" y1=\"400\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"500\" stroke=\"#4fd39a\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"440\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"440\" stroke=\"#4fd39a\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n<line x1=\"420\" y1=\"420\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"460\" stroke=\"#4fd39a\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"440\" y1=\"420\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"460\" stroke=\"#4fd39a\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n<line x1=\"440\" y1=\"440\" x2=\"520\" y2=\"440\" stroke=\"#4fd39a\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"545\" cy=\"440\" r=\"18\" stroke=\"#4fd39a\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n<path d=\"M300 520 H600 L630 545 H270 Z\" fill=\"#1a232d\" stroke=\"#2fa4ff\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n<rect x=\"680\" y=\"470\" width=\"60\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#ffc53d\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><path d=\"M740 490 h18 a14 14 0 0 1 0 28 h-18\" stroke=\"#ffc53d\" stroke-width=\"5\"/>\n<path d=\"M120 690 Q450 600 780 690\" stroke=\"#36cfc9\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-dasharray=\"14 12\"/>\n<text x=\"120\" y=\"740\" font-family=\"M,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#8f9aa6\">Georgia</text>\n<text x=\"780\" y=\"740\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"M,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#36cfc9\">Guam</text></svg><div class=\"lbl\" style=\"font-size:54px;color:#f5f7fa\">Reviewing ladder logic on the way to Guam</div><div class=\"foot\">Syon Automation LLC</div>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s13",
